              "fileId": "={{ $json.id }}"
            },
            {
              "content": "Extract all transactions from this PDF document and return valid and clean JSON matching the schema exactly. NEVER return line break references (\\n)\n\nFIELD RULES:\n- ticker: symbol in parentheses e.g. (AAPL). You MUST infer the corresponding Yahoo ticker based on the asset_name field if the ticker isn't explicitly stated in the document - every record returned MUST include a ticker. Never guess.\n- exchange: the exchange on which the ticker is traded, specifically the yahooExchange code e.g, NYQ, NMS etc\n- asset_name: full name excluding ticker and suffix brackets\n- action: BUY for purchases/exercises, SELL for sales/partial sales/DAF contributions\n- instrument: [ST]=shares, [OP]+call=call_options, [OP]+put=put_options, else other\n- dates: MM/DD/YYYY as printed. transaction_date and notification_date are separate fields\n- amount_low/high: numeric values from the printed range. midpoint: round((low+high)/2)\n- capital_gains: true only if checkbox is explicitly marked, otherwise false\n- description: verbatim as printed, empty string if absent\n- filer_name: as printed. filing_date: signature date. filing_id: top-right ID number\n\nNo text outside the JSON. No nulls — use \"\" or 0 if a value is absent."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_schema",
              "schema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"filer_name\":  { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"filing_date\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"filing_id\":   { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"trades\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"ticker\":            { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"asset_name\":        { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"action\":            { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"BUY\", \"SELL\"] },\n          \"instrument\":        { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"shares\", \"call_options\", \"put_options\", \"other\"] },\n          \"transaction_date\":  { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"notification_date\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"description\":       { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\"ticker\",\"asset_name\",\"action\",\"instrument\",\"transaction_date\",\"notification_date\",\"description\"],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"filer_name\",\"filing_date\",\"filing_id\",\"trades\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"
            }
          }
        }
